WEBVTT

00:01.110 --> 00:05.610
To expose the darkness
lurking in the city,

00:05.610 --> 00:08.320
an investigation is being conducted.

00:11.030 --> 00:13.700
We are meeting Raim at daybreak,

00:14.080 --> 00:16.120
but we can't reach him with telepathy.

00:16.120 --> 00:17.870
He last made contact with us

00:17.870 --> 00:20.590
when he was at the development
site of the school compound.

00:20.590 --> 00:24.420
It's unnatural to start battling
without any direct order.

00:24.420 --> 00:27.010
He would normally flee and escape.

00:27.010 --> 00:28.290
Indeed.

00:28.290 --> 00:31.720
Even if he was ambushed,
he's not one to be defeated so easily.

00:32.350 --> 00:36.350
There's a chance Rona has fooled us.

00:36.670 --> 00:40.100
She would have no problem
pulling this off in a calm demeanor.

00:41.900 --> 00:46.230
In any case, it's still too early
to draw any conclusion.

00:46.230 --> 00:47.520
Let's check the crime scene.

00:48.490 --> 00:50.780
NIGHT 9: THE PERVY DRAGON

00:51.910 --> 00:52.950
Darn it!

00:53.780 --> 00:55.950
I lost my precious katana.

00:55.950 --> 00:58.870
By the way, are you all right?

00:58.870 --> 00:59.710
Yes.

00:59.710 --> 01:01.620
But it bothers me that you asked.

01:01.940 --> 01:04.150
Sorry for dragging you into this.

01:08.920 --> 01:09.920
Stop right there!

01:09.920 --> 01:12.010
You wouldn't want to
lose your head here.

01:12.010 --> 01:13.010
Indeed.

01:13.340 --> 01:16.140
I still plan to live my life
to the fullest.

01:16.640 --> 01:20.440
I've grown tired of getting reincarnated.

01:24.610 --> 01:27.860
You have a sharp blade there.

01:27.860 --> 01:29.820
It's imbued with incredible power.

01:30.190 --> 01:32.200
I... I must contact the Young Master.

01:32.530 --> 01:35.530
Sorry, I have to cut you off
from using telepathy.

01:37.240 --> 01:40.960
I'm the kind who saves
the best for the last.

01:40.960 --> 01:42.740
I must land at least one hit!

01:46.860 --> 01:50.720
Sorry, things just got complicated.

01:50.720 --> 01:52.470
It's going to get a little rough.

01:57.390 --> 02:00.220
They will probably
be interested in this thing.

02:00.220 --> 02:02.850
You won't be killed right away.

02:02.850 --> 02:04.060
All the best.

02:10.070 --> 02:11.280
Are you all right?

02:11.860 --> 02:12.740
Who might you be?

02:13.070 --> 02:14.240
Keep quiet.

02:14.240 --> 02:15.530
- We must get out of here...
- Who's there?

02:15.530 --> 02:16.570
Did the subject get away?

02:16.570 --> 02:17.620
Stay alert.

02:17.620 --> 02:19.600
A strange magic sword.
Who are you?

02:21.330 --> 02:24.500
I'm doomed because I tried to save you.

02:24.500 --> 02:28.290
I didn't expect them
to abandon me so readily.

02:28.290 --> 02:31.420
Aren't you the school librarian?

02:31.420 --> 02:33.220
If I remember correctly, you're Eva.

02:34.180 --> 02:36.140
You know Mr. Kuzunoha very well, right?

02:36.430 --> 02:38.180
My name is Raim Rateh,

02:38.180 --> 02:40.520
and I am a shopkeeper
at the Kuzunoha Company.

02:40.520 --> 02:42.060
We probably met in the past.

02:42.400 --> 02:44.060
You're not a shopkeeper.

02:44.060 --> 02:45.610
Aren't you a bodyguard?

02:45.610 --> 02:47.270
They are pretty much the same thing.

02:47.610 --> 02:51.320
Let me confirm one thing with you.
Do you want to get out?

02:51.980 --> 02:54.490
They built a stronghold here.

02:54.490 --> 02:56.360
The organization must be massive.

02:56.360 --> 02:58.370
I bet they have help
from inside the academy.

02:59.030 --> 03:01.620
I am but an insignificant librarian.

03:01.620 --> 03:04.790
Escaping this jail won't change a thing.

03:04.790 --> 03:06.120
Makes sense.

03:06.420 --> 03:09.130
Besides, you suffered a miserable defeat.

03:09.130 --> 03:12.340
Don't worry.
That guy isn't here.

03:12.340 --> 03:14.630
I did my best to pull off a trick.

03:14.630 --> 03:15.590
What do you mean?

03:15.970 --> 03:17.800
When I cut him,

03:17.800 --> 03:21.760
I placed a marker on him
to track his location.

03:21.760 --> 03:23.930
Even if I believe you,

03:23.930 --> 03:26.020
I'm still in grave danger.

03:26.890 --> 03:28.730
If you intend to save me,

03:28.730 --> 03:32.550
I hope you take out the enemies
congregating in the compound.

03:32.550 --> 03:33.610
What's in it for me?

03:34.030 --> 03:39.870
I can provide valuable information
to your employer, Mr. Kuzunoha.

03:39.870 --> 03:43.450
In the event we manage to destroy
the entire organization,

03:43.770 --> 03:46.250
I shall reward you handsomely.

03:47.290 --> 03:48.420
Understood.

03:49.000 --> 03:50.500
Kaze-kuruma!

03:52.670 --> 03:55.010
You're probably used to
seeing magic items,

03:55.010 --> 03:57.720
but this is specially made
by our company.

04:01.180 --> 04:04.140
There could be some
repulsive stuff along the way.

04:04.470 --> 04:06.140
Are you ready?

04:06.140 --> 04:07.390
I'll do just fine.

04:14.110 --> 04:15.280
This is disgusting.

04:16.490 --> 04:19.990
Most of them are demi-humans.
There are some humans, too.

04:19.990 --> 04:23.490
They don't really target
any races in particular.

04:23.490 --> 04:25.620
Abductions and human experiments,

04:25.620 --> 04:27.750
and on such a large scale, too...

04:28.210 --> 04:34.000
Medical and chimera experiments that aim
to increase combat and magical power.

04:34.300 --> 04:38.720
I must contact the Young Master,
but I can't use my telepathy now.

04:40.010 --> 04:40.970
What are you doing?

04:40.970 --> 04:42.850
Releasing them from this misery.

04:42.850 --> 04:48.140
These utterly disgusting devices and files
should be destroyed.

04:49.270 --> 04:52.360
I can sense a dragon from this trace.

04:53.230 --> 04:56.230
Maybe this isn't the demons' doing.

04:56.230 --> 04:58.820
Rona isn't very close with any dragon.

04:59.200 --> 05:00.910
Speaking of dragons,

05:01.320 --> 05:04.780
it could be Lancer,
the wielder of the sword.

05:04.780 --> 05:07.410
They did claim to be working
for the demons.

05:08.500 --> 05:10.710
If that is the case,
this is a great opportunity.

05:10.710 --> 05:15.420
They shall regret ever hurting you
and die struggling in excruciating pain.

05:17.300 --> 05:21.050
Raim, you can be very effective
with your work.

05:21.050 --> 05:21.930
Shiki?

05:21.930 --> 05:25.810
We should call in Lady Tomoe
and Lady Mio for this,

05:25.810 --> 05:28.220
but given the urgency of this case,

05:28.220 --> 05:30.480
I have no choice
but to take on the mantle.

05:30.480 --> 05:34.400
To think such a wonderful opportunity
would present itself to me!

05:34.400 --> 05:36.360
This is perfect.

05:36.360 --> 05:38.320
Utterly perfect!

05:38.610 --> 05:41.570
The abyss of despair
goes a lot deeper for you,

05:41.570 --> 05:43.110
a bunch of fools!

05:43.450 --> 05:44.570
Young Master.

05:44.570 --> 05:45.450
Raim.

05:45.450 --> 05:47.120
What?

05:47.120 --> 05:50.580
Young Master,
sorry for the trouble I caused.

05:50.580 --> 05:52.670
Never mind.
I'm glad you're safe.

05:52.670 --> 05:54.500
Did you run into a dragon?

05:54.500 --> 05:55.790
A dragon?

05:55.790 --> 05:57.500
No, but I ran into her.

05:58.300 --> 05:59.870
Huh? Miss Eva?

06:00.340 --> 06:02.450
We both made it out safely.

06:02.860 --> 06:05.640
I'll deliver a detailed report
of the investigation later.

06:05.640 --> 06:07.560
What are you doing here, Miss Eva?

06:07.910 --> 06:10.980
Darn you, Raim...

06:10.980 --> 06:14.400
Why did you have to
show up so soon?

06:15.060 --> 06:17.520
I was on a roll just now!
You must pay for this!

06:17.520 --> 06:19.030
Shiki! Calm down!

06:19.320 --> 06:21.240
Smile! Put on a smile!

06:22.740 --> 06:24.660
KUZUNOHA

06:24.660 --> 06:26.200
Raim's report.

06:26.530 --> 06:29.490
The investigation on
Rotsgard Academy's development site.

06:29.490 --> 06:31.080
Report of the present.

06:31.790 --> 06:34.920
Who was the mysterious man
who made a fool out of Raim?

06:34.920 --> 06:36.670
Was he related to the organization?

06:37.420 --> 06:40.800
Young Master, Miss Eva would like
to speak with you.

06:40.800 --> 06:41.510
I got it.

06:42.670 --> 06:44.840
Go to Rona.

06:44.840 --> 06:47.890
Ask for her help finding
the collaborators in the academy.

06:48.220 --> 06:50.310
Understood.

06:50.310 --> 06:53.600
I'll do my best to instigate Rona.

06:55.030 --> 06:56.730
We are only having this conversation

06:56.730 --> 07:00.570
because I promised Mr. Raim
I'd provide valuable information.

07:01.150 --> 07:02.440
As for your reward,

07:02.440 --> 07:06.320
the payment will be made once those
who threaten my life are dealt with.

07:06.320 --> 07:08.580
I'll start by giving you the information.

07:09.080 --> 07:10.190
Speak away.

07:11.290 --> 07:17.830
I do know the people
in that portrait you were holding.

07:19.130 --> 07:23.340
It seems you've been
searching for those two.

07:23.340 --> 07:24.470
Yes.

07:24.470 --> 07:27.010
I'd like to know
where they have been to.

07:27.390 --> 07:29.260
Just as I expected.

07:29.260 --> 07:33.560
The man is an aristocrat holding
an important position in a country.

07:33.560 --> 07:37.350
The woman is a prestigious priest.

07:37.350 --> 07:40.530
An aristocrat and a priest?

07:40.940 --> 07:46.400
They are probably living their
peaceful life as a loving couple

07:46.400 --> 07:50.160
in the satellite state of Elysion
known as Kaleneon.

07:50.480 --> 07:51.410
However,

07:51.410 --> 07:54.540
they were exiled by the country
before they even got married.

07:54.540 --> 07:56.210
No one has heard from them since.

07:56.710 --> 07:58.620
Why were they exiled?

07:58.970 --> 08:01.170
I don't know the details.

08:01.170 --> 08:06.760
Kaleneon had lost most of its records
due to the great invasion.

08:07.060 --> 08:08.380
The great invasion.

08:09.010 --> 08:12.000
An invasion by the demons
that took place ten years ago.

08:12.000 --> 08:14.520
The demons secured
an overwhelming victory in the end.

08:15.310 --> 08:18.640
How do you know about their past?

08:19.600 --> 08:22.570
Because I was from Kaleneon.

08:22.900 --> 08:25.050
So, you were there
during the great invasion.

08:25.480 --> 08:26.150
Yes.

08:26.440 --> 08:29.490
But only Luria and I got away.

08:29.910 --> 08:33.450
We were branded the cowards
who abandoned their nation

08:33.450 --> 08:35.240
and managed to survive in shame.

08:36.620 --> 08:40.080
We are not even allowed to
announce our family name.

08:40.919 --> 08:43.460
People who somehow
learned about our past

08:43.460 --> 08:45.340
still loathe us to this day

08:45.340 --> 08:46.890
and would cause us trouble.

08:47.590 --> 08:51.310
Luria and I thought
about ending our lives.

08:51.310 --> 08:53.180
But that wouldn't
have done us any good.

08:53.180 --> 08:56.390
The mark of a coward
wouldn't disappear after our death.

08:56.930 --> 08:59.290
Therefore, I want to reclaim our home,

08:59.770 --> 09:01.440
to reclaim the land of Kaleneon.

09:01.440 --> 09:06.110
No, I'll be content with retaking
the lost territory of the Aensland family.

09:06.110 --> 09:09.070
But with just the two of you...

09:09.490 --> 09:11.860
When that thought came to me,

09:11.860 --> 09:14.160
I made contact with the organization.

09:14.660 --> 09:17.120
I see. Now I understand.

09:17.410 --> 09:21.120
The organization was founded by a group
that was anti-goddess.

09:21.120 --> 09:24.690
They exchanged technology
and knowledge with each other.

09:25.210 --> 09:27.960
It became a very powerful organization.

09:28.260 --> 09:31.000
To reclaim Kaleneon,

09:31.000 --> 09:33.930
I thought I could use them
to gather more information.

09:34.760 --> 09:36.890
And you ran into Raim.

09:36.890 --> 09:39.250
Both of you got caught afterward.

09:39.250 --> 09:40.100
Yes.

09:40.480 --> 09:42.020
I understand the situation now.

09:42.980 --> 09:46.440
I'll do my best to protect you
from any harm.

09:46.730 --> 09:48.970
Thank you so much.

09:52.730 --> 09:55.070
An anti-goddess group.

09:55.950 --> 09:59.790
If they are capable of retaking
lost lands from the demons,

09:59.790 --> 10:01.960
they could be involved in the war.

10:05.210 --> 10:06.460
Young Master, it's him!

10:06.920 --> 10:09.800
The mysterious man who made
a fool out of me is approaching!

10:10.970 --> 10:12.680
Raim, get Shiki here.

10:12.680 --> 10:14.340
Wait, let me...

10:17.020 --> 10:19.970
Tomoe and Mio?
What are you doing here?

10:19.970 --> 10:22.560
Our foe is quite formidable.

10:22.560 --> 10:24.440
Raim should stay out of this one.

10:24.440 --> 10:27.480
Lady Mio, don't be unreasonable.

10:27.480 --> 10:29.780
Everyone has their duty to carry out.

10:30.190 --> 10:32.190
You'd only get in our way if you stayed.

10:33.950 --> 10:37.070
You have nothing to worry about
with these two by my side.

10:38.530 --> 10:40.120
Understood.

10:47.310 --> 10:48.820
Nice to meet you.

10:48.820 --> 10:51.260
I am the guild master
of the Adventurers' Guild.

10:51.760 --> 10:55.470
I got rough with your employee
named Raim some time ago.

10:55.470 --> 10:56.970
So, I came to apologize.

10:57.220 --> 10:58.180
Huh?

10:58.550 --> 11:00.180
It's good manners to say that,

11:00.180 --> 11:02.770
but he could hold his own in a fight.

11:06.520 --> 11:09.320
So, about the purpose of this visit...

11:09.820 --> 11:10.850
That's right.

11:10.850 --> 11:12.230
The lady over there,

11:12.230 --> 11:14.610
could you bring us some fruits
to pair with the tea?

11:17.910 --> 11:20.530
Mio, bring him some fruits.

11:20.530 --> 11:23.370
Very well.
I'll be right back.

11:24.000 --> 11:26.420
If you have other tea leaves,

11:26.420 --> 11:27.600
please use those instead.

11:31.500 --> 11:33.880
Guild Master, what is it that you need?

11:34.210 --> 11:36.010
Come on, Makoto.

11:36.010 --> 11:37.760
Don't get so formal with me.

11:38.220 --> 11:40.100
There is no need for your brushtalk.

11:40.680 --> 11:42.470
I'm not a human.

11:42.470 --> 11:44.680
Enlighten me.

11:45.890 --> 11:47.560
How adorable.

11:48.230 --> 11:52.820
Are you concerned the goddess
might locate you?

11:53.690 --> 11:55.030
Don't worry.

11:55.530 --> 11:58.740
The goddess doesn't know
about your current circumstances.

11:58.740 --> 12:02.240
After all, she's done
all kinds of silly things.

12:02.530 --> 12:04.200
Who are you?

12:05.040 --> 12:06.580
So that's what you sound like!

12:06.580 --> 12:07.290
Not bad.

12:07.790 --> 12:10.790
You sound like a young boy.

12:10.790 --> 12:11.920
I'm quite fond of that.

12:11.920 --> 12:13.840
Enough jokes.
Answer me.

12:13.840 --> 12:14.760
Who are you?

12:15.190 --> 12:18.380
Sorry.
I forgot to introduce myself.

12:18.380 --> 12:19.260
Allow me to...

12:19.260 --> 12:21.800
Cut the act, Luto,

12:22.220 --> 12:23.390
Dragon of Myriad Colours.

12:24.890 --> 12:26.770
Are you talking about him?

12:27.310 --> 12:30.060
Yes. He is a greater dragon.

12:30.560 --> 12:33.150
The greatest there is.
He's never lost a fight.

12:33.770 --> 12:36.190
Myriad Colours
as in countless in number.

12:36.190 --> 12:37.900
That is Luto's nickname.

12:38.570 --> 12:39.890
This guy is a dragon?

12:40.690 --> 12:43.620
The greatest of the greater dragons.

12:43.620 --> 12:48.250
The Heavenly Sword, Waterfall, Sand Wave,
Crimson Lapis, and Night Clad.

12:48.250 --> 12:50.830
These five are the most well-known.

12:51.120 --> 12:53.760
Shin, did you spend so much time
slumbering in the wilderness

12:53.760 --> 12:56.500
that you forgot your manners?

12:57.170 --> 12:59.430
I'd like to speak with Makoto.

12:59.720 --> 13:02.260
No. I won't let you deceive him.

13:03.010 --> 13:06.680
Besides, I've forsaken that old name.

13:06.680 --> 13:07.900
I am Tomoe now.

13:07.900 --> 13:09.100
Fine.

13:09.730 --> 13:11.560
Sorry, Makoto.

13:11.560 --> 13:13.860
I never intended to deceive you.

13:13.860 --> 13:15.600
My intention is much more innocent.

13:16.900 --> 13:20.320
You sure have changed a lot.

13:20.320 --> 13:22.990
When did you become a man?

13:24.800 --> 13:26.950
Around 300 years ago.

13:26.950 --> 13:30.500
I had been a woman for too long.
I got bored eventually.

13:30.790 --> 13:32.750
He got bored of his own gender?

13:33.070 --> 13:37.250
I had a one-night stand
with a man one day.

13:37.250 --> 13:40.050
A sense of fulfillment
poured into my heart.

13:40.050 --> 13:43.550
I experienced bliss like nothing before.

13:43.550 --> 13:47.100
It was the ultimate end of friendship!
The greatest form of love!

13:49.100 --> 13:51.140
Makoto, are you still a virgin?

13:51.140 --> 13:54.270
It's all right.
I'm into your type as well.

13:54.770 --> 13:56.980
Whether my body is a woman or a man,

13:56.980 --> 13:59.860
I'm confident
I can conquer your heart in a day.

13:59.860 --> 14:01.200
I must refuse!

14:03.030 --> 14:04.780
What was the fuss about?

14:05.870 --> 14:07.990
I was merely wooing Makoto.

14:07.990 --> 14:08.950
Wooing...

14:09.240 --> 14:11.330
He is still single, right?

14:11.330 --> 14:13.960
It's perfectly fine
to present myself to him.

14:14.460 --> 14:18.300
Tomoe, this guy here
seems to be a dragon.

14:18.300 --> 14:20.370
I'm sure killing him
won't do any harm.

14:20.870 --> 14:23.510
Of course.
There will be nothing of him left.

14:23.760 --> 14:25.840
Luto, any last words?

14:25.840 --> 14:27.890
I'll be sure to write them
on your tombstone.

14:28.140 --> 14:31.810
Wait. A greater dragon
should taste pretty good.

14:31.810 --> 14:35.020
I plan to use every bit of his body
for my cooking.

14:35.330 --> 14:37.270
This is an unprecedented threat.

14:37.270 --> 14:39.730
I'll help you as much as I can.

14:40.070 --> 14:42.150
Wait... Hold on...

14:42.150 --> 14:45.570
I didn't come here to pick a fight.
I have an important matter to discuss.

14:45.570 --> 14:46.620
That's right!

14:46.620 --> 14:49.120
I'd like to talk about
the Adventurers' Guild.

14:49.490 --> 14:50.660
The guild?

14:50.660 --> 14:51.950
Young Master!

14:54.670 --> 14:57.460
Fine. I'll help you.

14:57.460 --> 15:00.010
But I get to decide
how to investigate it.

15:00.500 --> 15:02.380
You're not allowed
to condemn my methods.

15:03.800 --> 15:06.340
As despicable as always.

15:07.760 --> 15:09.050
Kuzunoha...

15:09.600 --> 15:13.310
Time to make use of the organization
to learn his true strength.

15:14.140 --> 15:17.600
My original mission
has been completed anyway.

15:19.690 --> 15:24.490
First off, I really am the guild master
of the Adventurers' Guild.

15:24.900 --> 15:30.160
More precisely speaking,
I founded the guild about 1000 years ago.

15:30.160 --> 15:30.990
Huh?

15:31.290 --> 15:33.870
The first master I served
was from a different world,

15:33.870 --> 15:36.460
just like you, Makoto.

15:36.460 --> 15:41.340
I learned new concepts from him
and proposed them to the goddess.

15:41.340 --> 15:43.170
I was then put in charge.

15:43.510 --> 15:44.610
I knew it.

15:44.610 --> 15:49.140
Me and those two heroes weren't the first
to have come from another world.

15:49.850 --> 15:54.270
At the time, I racked my brain
to put the guild together.

15:54.270 --> 15:57.100
I had fun while putting policies in place.

15:57.770 --> 16:00.020
The guild is now found all over the world.

16:00.020 --> 16:03.780
It has served its purpose of solving
communication problems.

16:04.320 --> 16:09.360
Members of the guild are given
a certificate that shows their levels.

16:10.450 --> 16:12.080
Don't you find it rather peculiar?

16:12.080 --> 16:15.120
The high-tech guild card
has the word "level" on it.

16:16.000 --> 16:18.120
In the world where you were from,

16:18.120 --> 16:20.960
it's a concept from video games.

16:23.210 --> 16:25.920
This world is beyond any logic.

16:25.920 --> 16:30.550
You can even say it's a skyscraper
built inside a wooden house.

16:31.470 --> 16:34.120
But a few words from
the Adventurers' Guild

16:34.120 --> 16:36.520
are all it takes for someone
like you to comprehend.

16:37.230 --> 16:38.190
You have a point.

16:38.730 --> 16:42.110
Why did you have this system in place?

16:42.690 --> 16:45.320
To maintain the balance of this world.

16:45.320 --> 16:46.940
Since ages ago,

16:46.940 --> 16:49.060
the goddess has always
favored the humans.

16:49.060 --> 16:51.320
Their populations grew,
and so did their arrogance.

16:51.320 --> 16:53.160
This is a means to restrict them.

16:53.530 --> 16:55.080
A limitation...

16:55.080 --> 16:58.040
Shouldn't the guild help
the humans make progress?

16:58.500 --> 17:01.250
You don't see the bigger picture here.

17:01.580 --> 17:04.540
With a leveling and ranking system
from the guild,

17:04.540 --> 17:07.010
people will strive to become better.

17:07.010 --> 17:11.180
The speed of their growth
will go up as they level up.

17:11.800 --> 17:14.640
Numbers bring motivation.

17:15.060 --> 17:19.430
Everyone wants to become famous
after joining the guild.

17:19.430 --> 17:21.190
These people long to succeed.

17:21.190 --> 17:21.900
And then...

17:23.270 --> 17:25.650
Excessive greed brings
about their destruction.

17:26.109 --> 17:28.650
The humans will be slowly phased out.

17:28.650 --> 17:29.900
That's the idea.

17:30.780 --> 17:32.530
Phased out...

17:32.530 --> 17:35.870
Is that really the right way
to maintain balance?

17:35.870 --> 17:37.490
It's one way to do it.

17:38.120 --> 17:40.750
People who are discontent
with the goddess' actions

17:40.750 --> 17:42.830
can be found everywhere.

17:43.290 --> 17:45.590
It's not limited to the shady organization.

17:47.460 --> 17:52.250
By the way, the highest level
in our guild is level 65535.

17:52.800 --> 17:56.010
My master has been saying
it's a romantic number,

17:56.010 --> 17:57.640
so it's been set that way.

17:57.640 --> 18:01.480
Romantic? The maximum value
of an unsigned 16-bit integer?

18:01.480 --> 18:03.730
We used to see that a lot
in video games.

18:05.360 --> 18:06.360
Luto.

18:06.360 --> 18:09.190
What is it?
Do you want to form a pact with me?

18:09.480 --> 18:11.030
Delightful!

18:11.030 --> 18:12.360
I'm willing to do anything.

18:12.360 --> 18:13.450
Had fun in bed...

18:13.450 --> 18:15.120
No! It's about your master.

18:15.820 --> 18:19.240
How can someone from 1000 years ago
know about video games?

18:20.500 --> 18:22.370
I can explain everything,

18:22.370 --> 18:24.040
but you have to listen until the end.

18:24.750 --> 18:28.170
If everyone falls asleep,
I won't hesitate to attack.

18:28.170 --> 18:29.380
Do we have a deal?

18:29.380 --> 18:30.330
Huh?

18:30.960 --> 18:34.510
But Mio here is a genius
who follows her instinct!

18:35.390 --> 18:37.970
SLEEPING SOUNDLY
She is already asleep!

18:37.970 --> 18:39.930
16 BIT
Mega!

18:39.930 --> 18:45.060
So, the energy scale at the moment
when a time paradox occurs

18:45.060 --> 18:47.270
can lead to disasters.

18:47.270 --> 18:49.980
But the probability
of that happening is tiny.

18:49.980 --> 18:51.360
Because of that,

18:51.360 --> 18:55.820
the passage of time in this world
and your world

18:55.820 --> 18:58.240
are based on different management systems.

19:01.870 --> 19:06.380
So, if I plan to return
to my original world,

19:06.380 --> 19:07.790
will I succeed?

19:08.170 --> 19:10.920
You never understood what I said.

19:11.210 --> 19:12.170
Young Master.

19:12.170 --> 19:15.720
To be honest, I didn't understand a thing.

19:17.260 --> 19:20.970
Well, to return to your world,

19:20.970 --> 19:25.310
the odds are extremely slim,
but there is still hope.

19:25.600 --> 19:26.850
What do you mean?

19:27.520 --> 19:29.730
Given the mana you possess now,

19:29.730 --> 19:31.780
teleportation should work fine.

19:32.570 --> 19:35.610
But the randomness
of the destination is too high.

19:35.610 --> 19:40.580
Even from a more optimistic perspective,
the chance is one in every ten million.

19:41.160 --> 19:43.790
Shiki said the same thing.

19:45.120 --> 19:48.500
Anyway, it's better for you
to look around for now.

19:48.500 --> 19:50.960
All right, I've said hello.

19:50.960 --> 19:52.960
Time to get going.

19:53.300 --> 19:54.510
Let me walk you out.

19:54.510 --> 19:58.010
Who knows what havoc you'd wreak
when you are left to your own devices?

19:58.010 --> 20:00.800
Come on.
You don't trust me at all.

20:01.390 --> 20:03.470
See you around, Makoto.

20:05.310 --> 20:10.190
Does distance make one yearn
for home even more?

20:21.410 --> 20:24.170
So, what do you want to know?

20:24.580 --> 20:26.540
You noticed.

20:26.540 --> 20:27.370
Certainly.

20:27.750 --> 20:31.080
What did you mean
you didn't understand a thing?

20:31.080 --> 20:32.560
You understood it all.

20:34.960 --> 20:36.300
The Young Master's world...

20:36.550 --> 20:41.680
People from his world
won't live to be 100 years old.

20:42.140 --> 20:43.180
Yes.

20:43.180 --> 20:45.930
They rarely do.

20:46.310 --> 20:49.020
Is that so? Such a short life.

20:49.020 --> 20:50.490
It's too short.

20:50.980 --> 20:53.150
This is the one thing we can't change.

20:53.150 --> 20:54.570
We can only get used to it.

20:54.820 --> 20:58.490
As of now, the Young Master
means the world to me.

20:58.490 --> 21:04.080
The vibrant world will be so dull
after his passing.

21:05.370 --> 21:10.040
People from another world rarely care
about those around them like he does.

21:11.040 --> 21:13.380
The pain of taking a life
was too much for him,

21:13.380 --> 21:17.260
but it pains him even more
to see his comrades get hurt.

21:17.260 --> 21:19.260
His stance is vague and unclear.

21:19.260 --> 21:21.720
He thinks like an ordinary person.

21:22.140 --> 21:24.640
Yet, the path he walks
is an extraordinary one.

21:26.850 --> 21:29.590
What do you think he'll do?

21:30.060 --> 21:32.560
Will he try to return to his world?

21:32.560 --> 21:33.940
No idea.

21:34.520 --> 21:38.240
He doesn't seem like the ignorant kind
who would abandon you all.

21:38.530 --> 21:40.860
He will change
when the chance presents itself.

21:41.910 --> 21:42.950
A chance?

21:43.780 --> 21:47.870
The other two heroes have
bid their world farewell

21:47.870 --> 21:50.000
and decided to walk their own paths.

21:50.660 --> 21:55.710
Makoto could make a third choice
should he ever get the chance.

21:56.420 --> 21:59.210
A choice other than leaving or staying.

21:59.590 --> 22:02.840
What other option does he have?

22:06.470 --> 22:08.350
Traversing between two worlds.

22:08.640 --> 22:11.230
To move freely between worlds.

22:11.230 --> 22:13.770
In other words,
he will become a being unlike anything.

22:14.600 --> 22:17.860
What will bring about his awakening?

22:17.860 --> 22:19.900
I look forward to finding out.

22:21.860 --> 22:23.490
A trigger...

22:24.320 --> 22:30.620
If this is the only way to prevent
a future where he perishes,

22:30.620 --> 22:32.210
I shall...

22:32.210 --> 22:33.580
Tomoe.

22:34.040 --> 22:37.040
That pervert finally left.

22:37.380 --> 22:40.210
Mio, did you just walk here in that?

22:40.210 --> 22:42.590
Yes. What's wrong?

22:42.590 --> 22:44.880
It's nighttime, but this is inappropriate.

22:44.880 --> 22:47.140
There could be bad rumors
about the Young Master.

22:47.470 --> 22:51.600
I'll just have to make
the witnesses forget immediately.

22:51.600 --> 22:54.640
It would take a lot
more than mere gossip

22:54.640 --> 22:56.630
to make me take off
the love he showed me.

22:56.630 --> 22:58.790
You are as exhausting as always.

22:59.400 --> 23:02.110
I can say the same about you, Tomoe.

23:02.490 --> 23:07.870
If you ever get blinded by temptations
and seek to harm the Young Master,

23:07.870 --> 23:08.830
I won't hesitate...

23:10.910 --> 23:12.910
That will never happen.

23:13.290 --> 23:16.210
If I ever let temptations
get the better of me,

23:16.210 --> 23:20.090
simply give me a slap and wake me up.

23:20.090 --> 23:23.050
Sure.
It's going to be a hard slap.

23:35.060 --> 23:39.770
NEXT EPISODE: TIME FOR REFORMATION
Night 10: "Time For Reformation."
